Package: astroute
Version: @VERSION@-1
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Astroute contributors <motixo@users.noreply.github.com>
Section: net
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/cosmic-utils/astroute
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.35), libgcc-s1, libxkbcommon0, libwayland-client0, libwayland-cursor0, libegl1, libgl1, libfontconfig1, libinput10, libudev1, nftables, iproute2, pkexec, polkitd, ca-certificates
Description: Per-application network controls for COSMIC
 Choose network access, interfaces and SOCKS5 or HTTP(S) proxies for native desktop apps.
